        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Mental health researchers don't know whether bipolar disorder has a genetic component. So what? Well, if they knew, they might be able to figure out something more important: How can that condition best be tested for and treated? cost/larger question",
            "block_bbox": [
